# Codemod Recipe

This workspace uses **codemod-recipe** for deterministic AST edits via sandboxed Luau recipes and the Rust MCP server (`codemod-mcp`).

## Modes

| Mode | When | Skill |
|------|------|-------|
| **Architect** | Create/modify recipes, components, queries, templates | `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/architect/` |
| **Builder** | Understand the workspace or apply registered recipes/components | `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/builder/` |

Usage docs (SSOT) live under `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/docs/` after bootstrap (same content as `docs/usage/` in the framework repo). Skills are thin indexes into those docs — do not maintain a parallel API manual.

## MCP

- Always `preview_recipe` before `apply_recipe` (pass `previewToken`)
- Components: `component_dry_run_hook` before `component_apply_hook`
- Start: skill `codemod-recipe` → Architect or Builder

## Companion

Prefer **codebase-memory-mcp** for symbol locate before crafting edits. If missing, suggest installing it; do not auto-install.
